  "_comment": "Default seed roster — Aldric / Pippin / Selina / Elminster, the four characters a player gets if they hit \"Start New Game\" without using the /party editor to build their own. clearStoredRoster() drops the localStorage entry and the loader falls through to this file. Members start at level 1 with class-appropriate base stats, equipped with a Club + Cloth armor, and the shared inventory holds the basic starter kit (1 Torch, 20 Rocks, 10 Lockpicks) plus 50 gold. Stat lines are the post-racial-modifier effective scores shown on the form-party screen (Pippin is Halfling — his STR -2 / DEX +2 / WIS +1 are already baked into the numbers below). This is the canonical source — `web/public/data/party.json` is auto-generated by `web/scripts/sync-modules.mjs` on every `predev` / `prebuild`, so edits to that mirror get overwritten; edit this file instead.",
